  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Population Fund (UNFPA) Supplies Multiyear Contribution</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">United Nations Population Fund (UNFPA) Supplies supports the development of a sustainable country-defined, country-driven and country-funded process to improve the availability of key reproductive health commodities to the last mile, ensuring people have access to a range of quality assured products. UNFPA Supplies focuses on commodity procurement and strengthening the supply chain including domestic financing. Australia&apos;s contribution to UNFPA is primarily centred on the Pacific island countries and territories with the goal of ensuring reproductive health commodities are universally available.</narrative>
  </description>
